  "long_desc": "After many beautiful km through Navarra, today we crossed into a new region La Rioja, known for its wines, landscapes, and warmth. Our steps felt a bit lighter knowing we were getting closer to one of our key milestoness, the capital city Logroño and a much needed rest day. Crossing a provincial border on the Camino feels symbolic, like closing one chapter and beginning the next. New views, new scents, new encounters and new friends. And tomorrow, no walking boots, heavy backpack, no kilometers. Just rest!",
